To handle variable input rates and adapt its behavior dynamically, this implementation includes mechanisms to monitor system load and input characteristics, and adjust resource usage accordingly. It also includes error handling and cleanup mechanisms to ensure that the function does not introduce bottlenecks or become a single point of failure.

