The function also maintains counters for the total number of processed log entries, unique status codes found, and unique PIDs found. These counters are updated as new log entries are added to the queue.

To handle memory allocation failure, the function uses a robust mechanism to clean up any allocated resources before exiting with an error code. It also provides clear and informative error messages for different failure conditions.

